    <string name="setlib_card_hint">%1$d sets for a task — back, joints, hips, shape, strength, sleep — plus the extra sets and 6 set-training sets from the books. Picked for you after the tests.</string>
    <string name="setlib_hint">Choose a set for your task. After the health check and the movement test the app puts the ones that suit you first; poses unsafe for your limits are replaced in every set.</string>
